[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2697978060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103570#issuecomment-2697978060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103570","id":2697978060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gz-DM","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T15:13:05Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T15:13:05Z","body":"Your Control hovers the full rect and its `mouse_filter` is set to `Stop`:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e249fc3b-c47d-4a81-9496-e458450628bf)\n\nHence it prevents mouse input events from reaching physics picking step, see [the docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/inputs/inputevent.html#how-does-it-work). Changing `mouse_filter` solves your issue.\n\n---\n\n> ### Tested versions\n> -happens in Godot_v4.3-stable_win64 and Godot_v4.4-stable_win64\n> -doesnt happen in Godot_v4.1.2-stable_win64\n\nThe behavior is changed since v4.2.dev2.official [da81ca62a], this was done intentionally in #79443:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1753893c60ac309c21a77201725fa